        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.22,
          "end": 46.55,
          "en": "We can see this is 4.5MB and this contains the whole work of William Shakespeare.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.55,
          "end": 52.67,
          "en": "If we open that with a text editor, we can see here it's quite long and we can already see here it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.67,
          "end": 55.22,
          "en": "has almost 190,000 lines.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.22,
          "end": 56.84,
          "en": "This can easily happen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.84,
          "end": 59.75,
          "en": "It's just or it's just quite a few books here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.75,
          "end": 62.76,
          "en": "But we might also have log files that we want to analyze.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.76,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "So in practical terms, we might usually or we will usually just analyze log files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 72.18,
          "en": "But here we want to analyze the complete works of William Shakespeare.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.42,
          "end": 80.01,
          "en": "We can now search for patterns here in our text editor through control W control and w this is the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
