          "start": 80.01,
          "end": 81.36,
          "en": "editor Nano here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 81.36,
          "end": 87.06,
          "en": "And in that we can search with this keyboard combination and I could search for example, for Romeo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "if I'm interested in Romeo and Juliet and then we can see this is the whole book, and then we could",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 93.24000000000001,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "try to run this search over and over again, and then we could try to manually count how often this",
